---
title: Prototype Description Service Startup
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as Uvicorn/CLI
    participant App as api.main:create_app
    participant Settings as recognition.config.get_settings
    participant Cache as configure_dev_cache()
    participant Static as FastAPI StaticFiles
    participant Routers as recognition.interface_adapters.http.router
    participant Session as db.session.async_session_factory

    CLI->>App: import api.main:app
    App->>App: configure_logging("INFO")
    App->>Cache: configure_dev_cache()
    App->>Settings: load YAML + .env -> RecognitionConfig
    App->>Static: mount thumbnails_dir (base_url from settings)
    App->>Routers: include /recognition + /roster + /scene routers
    App->>Session: wire get_session dependency
    App-->>CLI: FastAPI app ready
    Note over Routers,Session: Per-request dependencies set app.current_tenant for RLS
